<main id="main"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page"><span>Bank Statement Loans in Miami</span></li></ol></nav></div><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Self-employed mortgage options</p><h1>Bank Statement Loans in Miami</h1><p>Mortgage options for self-employed borrowers, business owners, and Miami buyers with complex income documentation.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Review My Income Scenario</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Start Review</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami · Florida</span><span class="trust-pill">Call (305) 988-4806</span></div></div><div class="hero-panel rate-card"><div class="rate-item"><span>Best first step</span><strong>Preapproval</strong></div><div class="rate-item"><span>Core review</span><strong>Payment + cash to close</strong></div><div class="rate-item"><span>Miami focus</span><strong>Condo + jumbo checks</strong></div><a class="btn btn-primary full" href="start.html">Send Scenario</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><p>Bank statement loans may help self-employed borrowers qualify using business or personal bank statement cash flow instead of traditional tax return income. These programs can be useful when tax returns do not fully reflect current business income.</p><p>The right structure depends on deposits, expense factors, credit profile, reserves, property type, occupancy, and down payment.</p><h2>Who may consider a bank statement loan</h2><p>Business owners, contractors, consultants, real estate professionals, restaurant owners, medical professionals, and other self-employed borrowers may benefit from reviewing bank statement options.</p><p>This does not mean documentation is light. Lenders still review income consistency, deposits, business activity, assets, credit, property type, and ability to repay.</p><h2>What documents may be requested</h2><p>A lender may request 12 or 24 months of bank statements, business licenses, CPA letters, profit-and-loss statements, identification, asset statements, credit authorization, and property details.</p><p>Because each program is different, compare the estimated payment, cash to close, rate, and long-term refinance strategy.</p></article><aside><form class="lead-form lead-form-compact" method="post" action="quote.html" data-lead-form><h2>Request a Bank Statement Loans Miami Quote</h2><p>Answer a few basics and we’ll review the best mortgage path for your scenario.</p><input type="hidden" name="source_page" value="preview"><label>Loan goal<select name="loan_goal" required><option value="">Select one</option><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinancing</option><option>Cash-out refinance</option><option>Investment property</option><option>Condo financing</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Purchase price / value<input name="property_value" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input name="down_payment" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="$100,000"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit score range<select name="credit_score"><option value="">Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720–759</option><option>680–719</option><option>640–679</option><option>Below 640</option><option>Not sure</option></select></label><label>Property city<input name="property_city" placeholder="Miami"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label><label>Phone<input name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required></label></div><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="submit">Start Mortgage Review</button><p class="form-note">No obligation. Mortgage options depend on underwriting, lender guidelines, property type, and documentation.</p></form></aside></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="cta-band"><div><p class="eyebrow">Fast next step</p><h2>Get a mortgage scenario review before you make a decision.</h2><p>Send purchase price, down payment, credit range, income type, and property city. The goal is to compare real options, not guess based on generic rates.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="tel:+13059884806">Call (305) 988-4806</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section faq-section"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Bank Statement Loans in Miami FAQ</h2><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Are bank statement loans only for self-employed borrowers?</summary><p>They are commonly designed for self-employed borrowers and business owners, but eligibility depends on the program and documentation.</p></details><details><summary>Can bank statement loans be used for condos?</summary><p>Sometimes. The condo building and loan program both need to be reviewed.</p></details><details><summary>Are rates higher than conventional loans?</summary><p>They may be different because the documentation and underwriting structure are different. A full comparison is needed.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="section related-section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Keep comparing</p><h2>Related mortgage pages</h2><div class="card-grid small-grid"><a class="mini-card" href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">Jumbo Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="dscr-loans-miami.html">DSCR Loans Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="foreign-national-mortgage-miami.html">Foreign National Mortgage Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-miami.html">Mortgage Broker Miami<span>→</span></a></div></div></section></main>
